    "title": "Authorities investigating after pursuit leads to crash near University Avenue in Little Rock - NewsBreak",
    "text": "LITTLE ROCK, Ark. – Little Rock police and Arkansas State Police are investigating after a crash near Interstate 630 and University Avenue. Authorities said the crash happened just after 8 p.m. near a roundabout in the District shopping center. A spokesperson for the Little Rock Police Department said the car crashed after being chased by police. No injuries have been reported. There is no word yet on what led up to the pursuit. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KARK.",
